stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> ChatList
    ChatList --> Viewing: Tap thread
    Viewing --> ChatList: Back
    Viewing --> Focused: Tap composer
    Viewing --> Status: Tap remote status
    Viewing --> ThreadMenu: Tap overflow

    Focused --> AddMenu: Tap add
    Focused --> Permissions: Tap permissions
    Focused --> Intelligence: Tap model/intelligence
    Focused --> Voice: Tap microphone
    Focused --> Viewing: Dismiss keyboard
    Focused --> StartingTurn: Submit while authoritative idle
    Focused --> SteeringTurn: Steer while authoritative active

    AddMenu --> Focused: Select or dismiss
    Permissions --> Focused: Select or dismiss
    Intelligence --> Focused: Select or dismiss
    Status --> Viewing: Dismiss
    ThreadMenu --> Viewing: Select or dismiss

    Voice --> Focused: Stop/finalize or cancel
    Voice --> StartingTurn: Send while authoritative idle
    Voice --> SteeringTurn: Steer while authoritative active

    StartingTurn --> Active: turn/start accepted
    SteeringTurn --> Active: turn/steer accepted + expected turn identity
    Active --> Focused: turn completed
    Active --> Interrupting: Stop
    Interrupting --> Focused: turn/interrupt accepted

    Viewing --> Resuming: status notLoaded / open thread
    Resuming --> Viewing: authoritative loaded state restored
    Viewing --> Reconciling: authority lost
    Focused --> Reconciling: authority lost
    Reconciling --> Viewing: authoritative state restored
    Reconciling --> SystemError: authoritative systemError
